<description>&lt;p&gt;Government forces are massing near opposition leaders' homes while rival groups have seized three towns, intensifying fighting in southern and central Somalia. The UN has called for an immediate halt to combat in Baidoa as famine, displacement and flood risks worsen. A UAE drone strike in Puntland killed a Somali family, and Al-Shabaab continues attacks, exemplified by an IED detonation that injured six people. The conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxQMXEzQkZkeU1HQmlsNzFDUUhDbnVmbngtbVZGd2tZNGhjaUtzWEZqQ0pvSTF4bW16ZjljbWU2YlBkdl9OVFFJRE5xVXJoVXZCZGI4cl9ubDdrNnlpUXBiUUJLOVdKZ1hRbG52RjAyYWY2VTByS0V5a3BuYzM0dDNpZ0ViT2pNcEZ4dW1ITmFoajNwaW9zNWZLTkxQM3JRcHRwbVdGNXo0cWVEMmZsdk9jdk1xSk9xX1hqS25VTFl2QQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxNODRacDIweFlsNFdaY2VySjhHTVpYald2bzFwMGluQWwyYzBRTXE2c2FMaG13Z29ROXpQdFd6eThnVk5XTmJCNmt3R3BUeFJhbktLX3pKb2R3RkNsbU4xanNuc1Z4TXhZOXpMUVNhc0oyVDBJMzVhNXN5ZlVwN1FYbmFoYWlCbGJPWG5Ec0h3bw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxNMDdRaUdwYnpUZ09hVDdfZlhsbC1ocklGSWJYLW5ROUhBMldkd3pVenZDN25QbzFvTHdCQkVqN3RuWEJQQ2ZuQkh3SmVfaWt1WDNzcmhJYXRQRko3eWdGdlBDT0NGZXV6ajhhNTNpYmlnQnI3cDBVY1VCWkk2Q3JJSHlwN0RZTVY3d2sxSWJSdDlWU3FOWjFpcnRodw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxOTFFaem5Qclo3dDFVRVZ5ZnBPVF9CWDdENndiVU1jLU9NaFd2NkNtZmtiUWx4cTRJcXFNWERzQllHSXNrcXV1QW1kcVFlNXBScGFDaWhlQkFuc01EZEFSbTJSYzFlTlYyQjdwcFA5TWdJS2JlWDNxbmpMaEltWlB4anFBbHl5V3QxaEd2Qzh5bFZPQ2hydUM4MDdqMXdqUHRUYUU1MTZ4V2k4RHY5T3FqaDVZNEY?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somalia Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&